  Which pool that 100000000 is in, because the grouping is by feed and two
  adapters name PC_NAV: all of it is in the cross-chain CCTP adapter
  (CDSO4GJR...), and the private credit adapter holds nothing. That adapter is
  outside the awarded scope and is declared as such in docs/TRANCHE2_EVIDENCE.md.
  The exposure belongs in the private credit adapter. It cannot be moved by a
  call: deallocate on that adapter fails with ReturnNotArrived (714) because the
  USDC was burned through CCTP and has not come back, so the ways out are a CCTP
  return or a write_down.

